# This folder mixes the actual companion-app/ project with loose build
# output (signed APKs/AABs, a keystore, source-export zips) that got
# saved alongside it rather than into companion-app/ itself. None of
# that belongs in version control -- see companion-app/.gitignore for
# the project's own ignores.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.apk
*.aab
*.zip
.DS_Store
